+ * USBH  43
+ * OTG   44
+ * LPTIM 47,48
+ * I2C6  54
+ * IPCC  61,62
+ * HSEM  63,64
+ * SEV   65,66
+ * HDMI  69
+ * ETH   70,71
+ * DTS   72
+ * CPU2  73
+ * CDBG  75
